    NodeOfPerception->>Gateway: Send data
    Gateway->>ControlAgent: Forward data
    ControlAgent->>RegionalCoordinationService: Coordinate actions
    ControlAgent->>SupervisionPlatform: Report status
    PredictionService->>PlanningService: Generate predictions
    PlanningService->>ControlAgent: Distribute plans
    ConflictResolutionService->>ControlAgent: Resolve conflicts
    ResourceManagementService->>ControlAgent: Manage resources
    AuditService->>SupervisionPlatform: Log actions

    Gateway->>ServiceMeteorológico: Fetch weather data
    Gateway->>SistemaEnergético: Fetch energy data

    Operador->>SupervisionPlatform: Approve/Reject plans
    Administrador->>SupervisionPlatform: Define priorities
    ResponsableInfraestructura->>SupervisionPlatform: Monitor network status